    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Saulo yali ng'ali kutuubatuuba n'obusungu obw'okwita abeegeresebwa ba Musengwa. Yaaja ew'Omukulu wa Bakabona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaamusaba embaluwa emwandhula mu sinagoga edh'e Damasiko, nga bw'ayagaanayo abasaadha n'abakazi abatambulira mu ngira ya Musengwa, aghange okubaleeta mu Yerusalemu nga basibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano, bwe yali ng'ali kuja ng'ali kumpi okutuuka e Damasiko, mangu ago ghaabaagho okumyansa okwava mu igulu kwamwezungulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagwa ghansi era yaawulira eiroboozi nga limukoba liti: “Saulo, Saulo! Lwaki onkiriga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairamu ati: “Niiwe ani Musengwa?” Yaakoba ati: “Ninze Yesu y'okiriga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye situka oje mu kibuga. Eyo ye banaakukoberera ky'ogwaine okukola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaadha abaali batambula ni Saulo, baayemerera nga beewuunhia kuba baawulira eiroboozi aye baaloba kubona muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yaasituka okuva ghansi, yaakanula amaiso aye nga tasobola kubona. Baamugema ku mukono, baamutwala mu Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamalira irala enaku isatu nga tabona era nga talya waire okunhwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Damasiko mwalimu Omwegeresebwa nga ayetebwa Anania. Musengwa yaamubonekera yaamweta ati: “Anania.” Yairamu ati: “Ndi ghano Musengwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa yaakoba ati: “Situka ogeme Engira eyetebwa Entereevu, onoonie mu nhumba ya Yuda omuntu ayetebwa Saulo ow'e Taruso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yali ali kusaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yabonekerwa omuntu ayetebwa Anania nga aidha okumwisaaku emikono, aghange okwiramu okubona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anania yairamu ati: “Musengwa, nawulira abantu kamaala nga boogera ku musaadha oyo ebibi kamaala bye yakola abantu bo ab'e Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era ni ghano ng'ali n'obuyinza obumugheereibwa Bakabona Abakulu ageme abo abakusinza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa yaakoba Anania ati: “Ja, kuba oyo nze mmwerondeire okumanhisa eriina lyange mu bamaghanga agandi, ni bakyabazinga, n'abantu ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ndimwoleka nga bw'aja okudaagadaaga einho ku lwange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Anania yaasituka yaaja mu nhumba yaamwisaaku emikono yaamukoba ati: “Owoluganda Saulo, Musengwa Yesu mwene eyakubonekera, bwe wali mu ngira ng'oidha, antumye oghange okwiramu okubona era oidhule Mwoyo Mutukuvu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mangu ago, ku maiso ge kwava ebintu ebiri ng'oti bigalagamba, yairamu okubona. Yaayemerera, yaabatizibwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era yaalya emere, yairamu amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yamala enaku ng'ali n'abeegeresebwa mu Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibwalwa yaayegeresa mu sinagoga ati: “Yesu n'Omwana wa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boonaboona abaamuwulira beewuunhia inho, bakoba bati: “Ono ti n'omusaadha eyakiriganga ab'omu Yerusalemu abaasinzanga Yesu oyo? Era ti yaidha eno abageme abatwale ye Bakabona Abakulu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Saulo yeeyongera bweyongere okuba n'amaani mu kwegeresa kwe. Yaasirisa Abayudaaya abaali mu Damasiko ng'akakasa ati Yesu ni Kurisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enaku kamaala bwe dhaabitagho, Abayudaaya beekobaana okwita Saulo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.11.32+2CO.11.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 11:32-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aye Saulo yaamanha olukwe lwaibwe. Omusana n'obwire baamweteega ku miryango egingira mu kibuga, bamwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwali lulala obwire, abeegeresebwa be baamutwala baamubisa mu kituli, baamwikiza ku kimante nga bamutaire mu kiibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo bwe yatuuka e Yerusalemu, yaagezaaku okweyimba n'abeegeresebwa aye boonaboona baamutya nga tibaikiriza bati yeena mwegeresebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Barunaba yaamugemaku yaamutwala y'Abatume yaabakobera nga Saulo bwe yali mu ngira n'abona Musengwa era Musengwa n'ayogera naye. Era yaabakobera nga Saulo bwe yayogera nga tatya e Damasiko mu liina lya Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaba nabo mu Yerusalemu nga wa idembe, yaayogeranga nga tatya mu liina lya Musengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayogeranga era yaatakananga n'Abayudaaya aboogera Olugureki, aye baayenda okumwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboluganda bwe baakimanha, baamugherekeraku okumutuusa e Kaisaria, baamugheereza e Taruso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Ekikunsu eky'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito eky'omu Buyudaaya mwonamwona, Galilaaya ni Samaria, kyaba miraala. Ekikunsu eky'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito kyakakata nga kiisa mu Musengwa ekitiisa, era kyagazigha nga Mwoyo Mutukuvu bw'akiyamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho, lwali lulala Petero bwe yali ng'atambulatambula, yaikirira eri abaikiriza ba Katonda abaali mu Ludda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo yaayagaanayo omusaadha nga eriina lye ni Ayenea eyagongobala n'agogomera ku ndiri okumala emyaka munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero yaamukoba ati: “Ayenea, Yesu Kurisito akuwonia. Situka ogoloze obuliri bwo.” Mangu ago, Ayenea yaasituka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona ab'omu Ludda ni mu Sharoni baamubona baikiriza Musengwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Yoppa mwalimu omukazi nga eriina lye ni Tabitha oba Dorukasi, ekitegeeza, empongo. Omukazi ono, yakolanga ebikolwa ebirungi era n'eby'ekisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nnaku edho yaalwala yaafa, baanaaza omulambo gwe baaguta mu kisenge ekya ghaigulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano Yoppa kyali kumpi ni Ludda. Kale abeegeresebwa abaali e Yoppa bwe baawulira bati Petero ali e Ludda, baamutumira abasaadha babiri baamukoba bati: “Tukweghembye tezaaku oidhe ye tuli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Petero yaasituka yaaja nabo. Bwe yatuuka baamutwala mu kisenge ekya ghaigulu. Banamwandu boonaboona baayemerera gh'ali nga balira era nga bwe bamulaga ebivaalo n'engoye edhindi Dorukasi bye yakola ng'akaali mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero yaabafulumya ku luya boonaboona, yaakuba amakiryaivu yaasaba era yaakyukira omulambo yaakoba ati: “Tabitha, situka.” Agho Tabitha yaazibula amaiso, era bwe yabona Petero, yaatyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero yaamugema ku mukono yaamwemereza. Agho yaayeta abaikiriza ni banamwandu yaamubalaga nga mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kino kyamanhibwa mu Yoppa yoonayoona, abantu kamaala baikiriza Musengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero yaamala enaku kamaala mu Yoppa ewa Simoni omughazi ow'amawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
